# docs-alignment fixtures

Inputs for `test/docs-tests-alignment.bats`. Each file plants exactly one
defect, so a check that reports nothing is told apart from a check that
examined nothing.

The extension is `.md.fixture`, not `.md`. A planted defect in a tracked `.md`
file would be found by the real-tree run of the gate and by
`scripts/docs-lint.sh`, and both would go red on their own fixtures. The gate
takes any path as an argument, so the extension costs nothing.
